 "remarks": "Turnkey Living with a private rooftop oasis in the heart of Stamford. Experience modern urban living in this sophisticated, 10-year-young condominium. Boasting 3 bedrooms and 2.5 baths, this home is gem. This unit has a lot of custom made details. Brand new appliances. Freshly painted and move-in ready. Sunlight pours through oversized windows. Quality millwork throughout. Gourmet eat-in kitchen with beautiful cabinetry. Family room/workout area/office adds extra living space. Washer/dryer conveniently located on upper level. Retreat to your ultra-private rooftop terrace for sunset cocktails or al fresco dining. Complete with two assigned #21 parking spaces, you're just steps away from Stamford's vibrant dining, shopping, and entertainment.",
